1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,100
Before the city wakes,
there is a little room to listen.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,700
A bicycle finds its way
through the morning.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,700
The shutters open.
Someone puts the coffee on.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,400
Ordinary things,
seen a little differently.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,400
We often forget how much a familiar place can change when we slow down.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,900
Take the longer way home.

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,100
There is more here
than you remember.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,300
A quieter kind of city.
A different way to see it.
